abstract: >-
  An exact computer-assisted certificate proving s(17) > 115325/24963,
  with a frozen mixed point/threshold certificate, independent rational containment,
  and two complete exact replay paths.
  / 一份精确的计算机辅助证书，证明 s(17) > 115325/24963，
  包含冻结的点/阈值混合证书、独立有理包含检查与两条完整精确复演路径。
keywords:
